    <string name="always_removed_note">XMP, IPTC, comments and embedded thumbnails are always removed; ICC color profiles are kept, so colors never change. Orientation and the HDR gain map carry nothing identifying, but dropping them can make a photo look rotated or flat. Videos (MP4, MOV, 3GP) are cleaned in place and streams are never re-encoded.</string>
